---
name: Normalize Zeek JSON logs from TCP to OCSF
description: |
  Accepts Zeek JSON logs as newline-delimited JSON over TCP and normalizes
  them to OCSF. Each record needs Zeek's `_path` field, which the
  `json-streaming-logs` Zeek package writes. Forward its `json_streaming_*.log`
  files with a log shipper, such as Fluent Bit or Vector.
---

accept_tcp "0.0.0.0:5555" {
  read_ndjson
  // Zeek writes nested fields with dotted keys, such as `id.orig_h`.
  this = this.unflatten(".")
}
zeek::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(this)
